WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 31=

01:39.400 --> 01:40.000
Yan Shang,

01:40.840 --> 01:43.230
you made such bold promises,

01:43.680 --> 01:46.640
yet failed to serve me
with all your loyalty and ability.

01:47.480 --> 01:49.230
You've failed to live up
to my expectations.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.230
I

01:51.790 --> 01:52.310
admit my guilt.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.920
The corruption in Lingnan

01:55.840 --> 01:57.510
was practically out in the open.

01:57.950 --> 01:59.510
Yet you claim you found nothing.

02:00.760 --> 02:04.120
How do I know you haven't colluded
with those corrupt officials

02:04.560 --> 02:05.640
and submitted a false report?

02:06.280 --> 02:07.310
For such gross negligence,

02:08.150 --> 02:09.960
even stripping you of your post
and executing you

02:10.470 --> 02:11.400
wouldn't be too harsh.

02:12.030 --> 02:12.590
Father!

02:22.400 --> 02:23.080
However,

02:23.800 --> 02:25.400
I've decided to show you mercy.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.840
I'll grant Wanyao's request

02:28.630 --> 02:29.870
and banish you from Sheng'an,

02:30.560 --> 02:31.750
never to return.

02:32.590 --> 02:33.520
Go to Lanyang.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.430
Serve as county magistrate.

02:40.310 --> 02:40.800
Yan Shang,

02:42.000 --> 02:42.520
thank His Majesty.

03:06.710 --> 03:07.310
(Today)

03:08.120 --> 03:09.120
(may be our final farewell.)

03:10.360 --> 03:11.750
(But as long as you choose life,
there's hope.)

03:13.430 --> 03:14.710
(Locked in this gilded cage,)

03:15.870 --> 03:17.360
(all by myself.)

03:18.240 --> 03:18.960
(And that's enough.)

03:23.680 --> 03:24.400
(Stay alive,)

03:25.470 --> 03:25.960
(Yan Shang.)

03:29.520 --> 03:31.480
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

03:33.680 --> 03:34.430
What's this?

03:37.680 --> 03:38.150
Your Majesty,

03:39.310 --> 03:40.590
I've reconstructed from memory

03:41.470 --> 03:43.240
three years of financial records
from Lingnan Circuit.

03:50.240 --> 03:50.870
Bring it here.

03:54.740 --> 03:55.980
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

04:10.740 --> 04:15.960
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

04:18.680 --> 04:20.190
You wrote all this from memory?

04:20.680 --> 04:21.430
I reconstructed this ledger

04:22.190 --> 04:23.870
from memory while in prison.

04:24.830 --> 04:26.120
Jiang Heng, Military Commander
of Lingnan,

04:26.750 --> 04:28.750
secretly conspired with the Crown Prince
and funneled him money.

04:29.310 --> 04:31.800
Under the guise of public works,
he enriched himself.

04:32.920 --> 04:33.800
Across 93 counties,

04:34.360 --> 04:35.390
fields lie barren
and granaries stand empty.

04:36.070 --> 04:38.040
People sell their wives and children,
yet still can't pay their taxes.

04:38.870 --> 04:40.070
Bones lie scattered
across the countryside,

04:40.920 --> 04:41.950
yet the authorities still demand
forced labor.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.480
I humbly beg Your Majesty

04:48.950 --> 04:50.160
to execute these corrupt officials

04:50.750 --> 04:53.240
and bring peace to Lingnan's
countless innocent souls!

04:59.580 --> 05:01.820
(Previous Grain Balance: 4,200 shi;
New Receipts: 2,800 shi)

05:07.510 --> 05:10.000
With nothing but your eyes and memory,

05:10.800 --> 05:12.070
you remembered all of this?

05:13.000 --> 05:13.480
Father!

05:14.750 --> 05:15.390
He's lost his mind!

05:15.680 --> 05:17.510
He's scribbled all this
without a shred of evidence.

05:18.190 --> 05:19.070
How can you believe him?

05:19.270 --> 05:21.950
I ask Your Majesty to choose any year,
prefecture, or county

05:22.870 --> 05:24.240
and investigate whatever you wish.

05:25.070 --> 05:25.870
Whether I've fabricated anything

05:26.720 --> 05:27.480
will be clear once the records
are compared.

05:28.390 --> 05:28.750
Very well.

05:30.190 --> 05:33.000
I'll summon those involved
for questioning

05:33.680 --> 05:34.310
and verify

05:35.270 --> 05:36.390
every page of these records.

05:38.070 --> 05:39.510
Then when you said

05:40.390 --> 05:41.240
disaster relief had been ineffective

05:41.920 --> 05:43.510
and your inspection
had uncovered nothing,

05:44.480 --> 05:45.830
you were lying to me?

05:55.600 --> 05:56.480
Take Yan Shang

05:58.160 --> 05:59.240
back to the Imperial Prison.

05:59.600 --> 06:00.070
- Yes, Your Majesty!
- Yes, Your Majesty!

06:19.830 --> 06:20.480
Wanyao,

06:21.480 --> 06:23.950
it seems he really
doesn't want to go to Lanyang.

06:33.630 --> 06:34.070
Stop!

06:36.120 --> 06:36.630
Move!

06:44.270 --> 06:44.800
Yan Shang,

06:45.870 --> 06:47.310
do you think you're some kind of hero?

06:49.390 --> 06:50.270
Let me tell you something.

06:52.160 --> 06:53.390
You're

06:54.830 --> 06:55.750
the stupidest,

06:56.600 --> 06:57.360
cruelest,

06:58.160 --> 06:59.430
most self-righteous man in the world!

07:03.070 --> 07:03.600
I'm sorry.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.560
What did I tell you?

07:08.310 --> 07:09.510
What did you promise me?

07:11.600 --> 07:12.720
Why did you lie to me?

07:14.870 --> 07:15.390
Yan Shang,

07:16.360 --> 07:17.270
I've always despised

07:18.680 --> 07:19.680
betrayal above all else.

07:20.460 --> 07:24.300
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

07:26.320 --> 07:32.430
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

07:33.980 --> 07:36.951
♪- Soar with the wind;
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

07:36.951 --> 07:38.809
♪Burning bright as a song♪

07:38.851 --> 07:42.241
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

07:42.860 --> 07:46.120
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

07:48.150 --> 07:51.520
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

07:52.780 --> 07:54.979
♪Not a single hour less♪

07:55.021 --> 08:01.731
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

08:02.580 --> 08:05.900
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

08:06.100 --> 08:09.569
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

08:09.611 --> 08:16.211
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

08:16.830 --> 08:18.469
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

08:18.511 --> 08:21.251
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

08:21.300 --> 08:23.420
♪You're the only one I need♪

08:24.080 --> 08:30.850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

08:31.230 --> 08:34.350
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

08:34.760 --> 08:36.640
♪My last untouched innocence♪

09:02.480 --> 09:03.390
By imperial decree!

09:03.790 --> 09:06.790
Princess Danyang is to reside
at Lizheng Hall for the time being.

09:25.980 --> 09:26.820
(Jiang Heng Colluded
with the Crown Prince to transfer funds)

09:27.360 --> 09:28.600
(Du Ping, Transport Commissioner
of Lingnan,)

09:29.030 --> 09:30.320
(falsified disaster relief expenses.)

09:32.420 --> 09:33.660
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping)

09:34.600 --> 09:35.430
(Labor-tax cloth:)
Pei Xuanming,

09:35.430 --> 09:36.550
(2,000 bolts due, 1,600 received;)
Director of the Bureau of Operations

09:36.840 --> 09:37.910
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming)
accepted bribes from the Crown Prince.

09:38.960 --> 09:40.200
(Wang Heling, Vice Minister of Revenue,)

09:40.440 --> 09:41.790
(falsified salt and iron tax records.)

09:42.540 --> 09:43.540
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping;
Pei Xuanming; Cheng An)

09:58.140 --> 10:00.841
(Wei Feng, Cao Jiashi, Zhang Ran, Liu
Mingzheng, Liu Lingming, Liu Dong,)

10:00.841 --> 10:01.780
(Zhou Dewei, Wang Jianian)

10:01.900 --> 10:04.940
(Funds transferred
to the Crown Prince's household.)

10:12.510 --> 10:13.080
What's the current

10:13.840 --> 10:15.440
troop deployment at Anwu Gate?

10:15.600 --> 10:16.240
Rest assured, Your Royal Highness.

10:16.960 --> 10:18.000
By the third quarter
of the Yin hour tomorrow,

10:18.240 --> 10:19.240
all the Jinwu Guards at Anwu Gate

10:19.480 --> 10:20.510
will have been replaced by our men.

10:20.910 --> 10:21.910
For now, the only troops we can rally

10:22.390 --> 10:23.630
are from the Shence Army's
Right Battalion.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.059
Then we can...

10:25.101 --> 10:25.651
Who dares barge in?

10:31.200 --> 10:31.550
Your Royal Highness.

10:32.480 --> 10:33.150
It's too late.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.480
By imperial command,

10:35.870 --> 10:38.080
I must escort the Crown Prince
to Liangyi Hall immediately.

10:38.550 --> 10:39.320
As for everyone else,

10:39.840 --> 10:40.550
arrest them all!

10:41.840 --> 10:42.200
Your Royal Highness!

10:42.320 --> 10:42.630
Your Royal Highness!

10:42.720 --> 10:43.219
- Move!
- Hurry up!

10:43.261 --> 10:43.539
Your Royal Highness!

10:43.580 --> 10:43.829
Move!

10:43.871 --> 10:44.539
Your Royal Highness!

10:44.581 --> 10:45.701
- Move!
- Save me, Your Royal Highness!

10:45.790 --> 10:47.150
Your Royal Highness!

10:47.630 --> 10:48.600
Your Royal Highness!

10:49.320 --> 10:50.000
Your Royal Highness.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.240
This way, please.

10:55.080 --> 10:55.440
Take a look.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.720
Apart from these people,

11:03.940 --> 11:05.580
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming)

11:07.600 --> 11:08.630
have I missed anyone?

11:14.100 --> 11:14.740
(Liu Mingzheng; Liu Lingming;
Wang Jianian)

11:18.720 --> 11:19.630
Xun,

11:20.840 --> 11:23.030
don't you owe me an explanation?

11:28.120 --> 11:28.960
Father,

11:30.390 --> 11:32.000
if I'd had nothing at my disposal,

11:32.910 --> 11:33.390
how could I

11:33.840 --> 11:35.480
have rescued you from Yu Cheng'an

11:35.960 --> 11:37.200
at the hunting grounds that day?

11:42.200 --> 11:42.750
Father,

11:44.720 --> 11:45.630
all these years,

11:46.790 --> 11:47.720
I've lived in constant fear for my life.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.200
Right under Yu Cheng'an's nose,

11:50.480 --> 11:51.840
I risked my neck recruiting troops
and forging armor.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.750
Why do you think I did all that?

11:56.000 --> 11:57.550
Don't you understand, Father?

12:27.480 --> 12:27.840
Get up.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.480
But Yu Cheng'an

12:45.550 --> 12:47.200
was executed over a month ago.

12:48.720 --> 12:50.320
Why have you never submitted

12:51.080 --> 12:52.200
an official report on the funds,
provisions,

12:53.270 --> 12:55.720
and private troops under your command?

12:59.670 --> 13:00.360
Why?

13:16.960 --> 13:17.840
Xun,

13:20.670 --> 13:23.080
that sword you turned
against Yu Cheng'an...

13:24.720 --> 13:25.360
Will you

13:27.600 --> 13:30.600
turn it against your own father
tomorrow?

13:51.840 --> 13:53.390
Since you've already made up your mind,

13:54.910 --> 13:55.960
why bother asking?

14:01.670 --> 14:02.840
You brought me

14:03.270 --> 14:04.360
here today

14:05.550 --> 14:06.630
and demanded an explanation.

14:08.360 --> 14:10.720
You just wanted to humiliate me again,
didn't you?

14:16.790 --> 14:18.030
Just like

14:22.030 --> 14:24.030
Yu Cheng'an did back then.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.120
How dare you!

14:42.550 --> 14:43.440
Father,

14:44.630 --> 14:45.750
the two of us...

14:47.200 --> 14:48.790
What a ridiculous pair we are.

14:51.270 --> 14:52.720
Absolutely ridiculous!

15:00.060 --> 15:06.300
(Universe in Harmony)

15:06.420 --> 15:07.700
(Lizheng Hall)

15:42.320 --> 15:42.720
(Your Highness,)

15:43.600 --> 15:44.550
(those commanders)

15:45.240 --> 15:46.360
(merely fear the Crown Prince's power.)

15:46.910 --> 15:48.030
(Do you think they're truly loyal?)

15:49.270 --> 15:50.510
(They're not men who would die for you.)

15:50.840 --> 15:51.840
(They're predators who would
turn on their own master.)

15:52.320 --> 15:53.360
(They're not your allies,)

15:53.670 --> 15:54.910
(but the very men who could
bring about your death.)

15:55.960 --> 15:56.870
(Those who bargain with tigers)

15:57.320 --> 15:58.270
(ultimately become their prey.)

15:59.320 --> 16:00.200
(As time goes on,)

16:00.840 --> 16:02.440
(I fear you'll sink into the same mire.)

16:03.320 --> 16:04.510
(How would you be any different
from the Crown Prince?)

16:09.510 --> 16:10.200
That's true.

16:12.200 --> 16:14.030
To fight my way out of this swamp,

16:16.270 --> 16:17.840
I'm bound to get covered in mud

16:18.720 --> 16:19.510
and resort to whatever it takes.

16:24.510 --> 16:26.440
But I won't become
as rotten as they are.

16:33.670 --> 16:34.360
(In the end,)

16:35.390 --> 16:35.870
(Yan Shang,)

16:37.120 --> 16:38.150
(you still don't believe in me.)

16:39.360 --> 16:41.120
(You don't believe I can forge
my own path,)

16:42.150 --> 16:42.910
(or that I)

16:43.840 --> 16:45.150
(can survive without bowing to anyone.)

16:48.320 --> 16:48.750
Hurry up!

17:01.630 --> 17:02.200
Keep moving!

17:05.920 --> 17:06.200
Hurry up!

17:06.640 --> 17:07.070
Keep moving!

17:09.510 --> 17:10.310
Keep up! Keep up!

17:13.030 --> 17:13.960
Yan Shang!

17:17.240 --> 17:19.030
I never thought I'd run into someone
I know in here.

17:21.110 --> 17:23.590
I didn't expect His Majesty
to act so quickly either.

17:24.830 --> 17:25.440
I suppose

17:26.000 --> 17:27.270
the officials in Lingnan
and other circuits

17:27.480 --> 17:28.720
who had secret dealings
with the Crown Prince

17:29.400 --> 17:30.510
have been dealt with by now.

17:31.200 --> 17:31.550
You...

17:35.480 --> 17:36.809
I still don't understand

17:36.851 --> 17:37.741
what you're trying to achieve.

17:38.350 --> 17:39.510
You'd already made it back alive.

17:39.750 --> 17:40.680
All you had to do was keep quiet,

17:40.920 --> 17:42.160
and neither of us
would be in this prison!

17:42.510 --> 17:43.030
Yang Si,

17:44.440 --> 17:45.750
when I first came to Sheng'an,

17:46.550 --> 17:47.880
I never expected to return home alive.

17:48.920 --> 17:49.350
And now,

17:50.680 --> 17:51.310
nothing has changed.

17:55.480 --> 17:55.790
Move!

18:13.000 --> 18:15.440
(Serene and Content)
Your Majesty confined the Crown Prince.

18:16.270 --> 18:18.720
What do you intend to do
with Meng Zaishi?

18:22.030 --> 18:24.899
There's one major difference
between Meng Zaishi

18:24.941 --> 18:26.501
and Meng Baiyu and Mu Xianqing.

18:27.640 --> 18:28.510
Do you know what it is?

18:29.550 --> 18:31.030
I've heard something about it.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.480
The soldiers under Meng Zaishi

18:33.680 --> 18:35.480
would all lay down their lives for him.

18:36.480 --> 18:40.310
He united the Central Circuit
in remarkably little time,

18:41.400 --> 18:42.310
not because

18:43.480 --> 18:45.350
he is a Meng,

18:46.000 --> 18:46.750
but because of

18:47.550 --> 18:50.160
how he leads his troops
and treats his men.

18:52.350 --> 18:52.960
Exactly.

18:54.070 --> 18:55.790
The Central Circuit's forces

18:56.720 --> 18:59.310
have effectively become
Meng Zaishi's private army.

19:00.880 --> 19:01.920
But as long as

19:02.310 --> 19:04.310
he remains here in Sheng'an,

19:05.350 --> 19:07.310
his loyal soldiers

19:08.240 --> 19:10.270
won't dare make a move against me.

19:12.200 --> 19:13.510
Your Majesty is wise.

19:14.350 --> 19:15.720
With one man in your hands,

19:16.240 --> 19:17.480
you can control an entire army.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.200
However...

19:24.110 --> 19:24.510
What is it?

19:26.070 --> 19:27.350
I just wonder

19:28.200 --> 19:29.960
how long this can last...

19:32.240 --> 19:32.720
Your Majesty!

19:35.750 --> 19:36.720
It's nothing.

19:42.400 --> 19:44.440
Perhaps I've overworked myself
these past few days.

19:44.830 --> 19:45.200
I'm tired.

19:46.110 --> 19:47.400
I'll go and rest.

19:51.550 --> 19:51.920
General,

19:52.510 --> 19:53.550
I've brought the pastries you asked for.

20:21.020 --> 20:24.460
(The ambush is in position.)

21:26.110 --> 21:26.440
Here they come!

21:26.590 --> 21:27.729
They should be cut to pieces!

21:27.771 --> 21:29.421
(Wontons; Flatbread)
It's them! Look at those people!

21:29.510 --> 21:30.440
They deserve to be cut to pieces!

21:31.310 --> 21:31.659
Keep moving!

21:31.701 --> 21:32.331
They deserve to die!

21:32.440 --> 21:32.859
Exactly!

21:32.901 --> 21:33.771
They never did anything good!

21:34.310 --> 21:34.960
Bad people!

21:35.310 --> 21:36.289
(Bamboo Goods Shop)
Kid, come here!

21:36.331 --> 21:36.629
Come here!

21:36.671 --> 21:37.061
Bad people!

21:37.160 --> 21:37.790
Where are your parents?

21:38.030 --> 21:39.550
They starved to death because of them!

21:40.720 --> 21:41.699
How does dirt taste?

21:41.741 --> 21:42.331
You corrupt officials!

21:42.680 --> 21:43.830
Corrupt officials! Scoundrels!

21:45.480 --> 21:45.830
Stand back!

21:46.240 --> 21:46.680
Stand back!

21:47.550 --> 21:48.000
Get back!

21:49.720 --> 21:50.400
Move along! Hurry!

21:50.640 --> 21:51.960
Everyone, calm down!

21:52.680 --> 21:53.400
Please, stay calm!

21:54.000 --> 21:54.699
Everyone, calm down!

21:54.741 --> 21:55.371
Make way! Move aside!

21:56.480 --> 21:56.899
Make way!

21:56.941 --> 21:57.461
Get lost!

21:57.550 --> 21:58.440
Back! Move back!

22:02.960 --> 22:03.680
- Xiaozhou's back!
- Father!

22:04.000 --> 22:04.350
Brother!

22:06.480 --> 22:08.240
Something's happened!

22:08.680 --> 22:09.270
What happened?

22:09.400 --> 22:10.160
Wonderful news!

22:10.480 --> 22:11.270
Wonderful news?

22:11.640 --> 22:12.070
Father,

22:12.400 --> 22:13.750
I heard the court sent troops

22:14.000 --> 22:15.640
to arrest the Military Governor
of Lingnan.

22:16.160 --> 22:18.400
Nearly all the corrupt officials
have been arrested too.

22:18.960 --> 22:19.960
When I went to the county market,

22:20.200 --> 22:22.270
I saw lots of people
who'd fled the famine

22:22.440 --> 22:24.110
returning home in groups.

22:24.830 --> 22:25.640
And when I got into town,

22:26.000 --> 22:27.750
I saw a notice posted at the city gate.

22:29.550 --> 22:30.310
What did it say?

22:30.590 --> 22:33.310
New disaster relief funds
will arrive within a month.

22:33.590 --> 22:35.590
They'll review land records
and return land to the people,

22:35.790 --> 22:37.400
and give landless refugees plots
to cultivate.

22:37.590 --> 22:38.030
And...

22:39.720 --> 22:41.400
There'll be no taxes for three years.

22:43.720 --> 22:44.590
Three years!

22:48.550 --> 22:49.200
It was Shang.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.270
Shang did this!

23:14.920 --> 23:15.400
Wanyao.

23:22.070 --> 23:22.790
Your Majesty.

23:29.480 --> 23:30.030
What?

23:30.790 --> 23:31.790
Are you angry

23:32.000 --> 23:32.750
because I made you reflect
on your actions?

23:37.160 --> 23:38.350
Everything Yan Shang wrote

23:38.790 --> 23:39.720
has been verified.

23:40.310 --> 23:43.480
Chancellor Liu said hardship
had strengthened his resolve.

23:44.310 --> 23:45.070
He was right.

23:49.750 --> 23:50.480
Just look at you.

23:51.070 --> 23:52.049
You were so picky,

23:52.091 --> 23:53.771
and look who you ended up with.

23:54.440 --> 23:55.480
How foolish!

23:56.270 --> 23:58.979
Even as the husband
of an ordinary woman,

23:59.021 --> 24:01.461
he'd never put his wife
and children first.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.030
How could he possibly be

24:03.270 --> 24:05.030
a suitable husband
for a princess of Huai?

24:06.030 --> 24:06.480
Your Majesty,

24:07.830 --> 24:08.750
I've already given up on him.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.270
Sit down.

24:17.510 --> 24:17.960
Wanyao,

24:18.480 --> 24:19.440
do you remember

24:20.070 --> 24:21.070
the story I once told you

24:21.960 --> 24:23.030
about Zhuangzi's

24:24.590 --> 24:26.400
useless tree?

24:27.790 --> 24:28.350
Being useless

24:28.920 --> 24:30.270
is what saves it from the axe.

24:31.200 --> 24:34.000
If you could simply be content
as a princess

24:34.830 --> 24:36.030
and stop meddling in things,

24:37.790 --> 24:39.270
you could keep yourself safe.

24:43.000 --> 24:43.830
That night at the hunting grounds,

24:45.000 --> 24:46.590
my own safety never crossed my mind.

24:52.200 --> 24:55.920
You're the second person
to bring up that night with me.

24:57.680 --> 24:58.400
Do you think

24:59.590 --> 25:01.350
I'm also trying to claim credit
and beg for mercy?

25:03.550 --> 25:06.480
If all women were this sharp-tongued,

25:06.750 --> 25:08.440
they'd only invite trouble.

25:16.830 --> 25:17.920
Think of your mother.

25:18.640 --> 25:21.030
How magnificent she looked
drawing her bow!

25:21.960 --> 25:24.790
And look how she ended up.

25:30.070 --> 25:30.920
Weapons like these

25:32.160 --> 25:34.070
can't protect a woman.

25:34.830 --> 25:37.030
They only bring deadly trouble upon her.

25:37.880 --> 25:38.920
Being gentle and yielding

25:39.510 --> 25:40.830
is the key to survival.

25:41.680 --> 25:43.310
Remember when you were little?

25:45.240 --> 25:47.400
You were gentle, sweet, and sensible.

25:48.270 --> 25:50.590
If you could be like that again,

25:51.510 --> 25:52.720
obedient and well-behaved,

25:53.550 --> 25:55.110
I would protect you

25:55.680 --> 25:56.400
and cherish you.

25:57.960 --> 25:59.240
Just keep your hands

25:59.960 --> 26:01.270
away from things

26:02.110 --> 26:03.550
you have no business touching.

26:06.750 --> 26:07.640
What happened to the Crown Prince?

26:10.480 --> 26:11.510
Huai

26:12.070 --> 26:13.070
no longer has a Crown Prince.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.440
You're different from him.

26:21.400 --> 26:23.440
You're my precious daughter.

26:24.400 --> 26:26.750
Now that Yan Shang is gone,

26:27.480 --> 26:29.200
you can continue living in the palace.

26:29.880 --> 26:30.790
What's more,

26:31.680 --> 26:34.310
I've even made the best arrangements
for you.

26:37.000 --> 26:37.310
No.

26:39.640 --> 26:40.590
I want to return to my residence.

26:42.110 --> 26:44.249
Your residence has no guards now.

26:44.291 --> 26:45.221
Don't go back.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.550
Stay here

26:47.480 --> 26:48.680
and keep me company.

26:50.880 --> 26:51.590
Back then,

26:52.350 --> 26:53.590
for the stability of Huai,

26:54.070 --> 26:55.880
you agreed to marry the Military
Commander of the Central Circuit.

26:57.110 --> 26:58.179
Now, Meng Zaishi...

26:58.221 --> 26:59.021
I won't do it!

27:04.750 --> 27:05.720
Why not?

27:06.310 --> 27:07.769
Meng Zaishi is in his prime,

27:07.811 --> 27:09.261
and he's devoted to you.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.880
Back then, I only gave in to Yu Cheng'an

27:11.400 --> 27:13.030
for your sake and Mother's.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.350
And now,

27:14.830 --> 27:16.350
my own father is the one forcing me.

27:18.030 --> 27:19.569
Oh, you silly girl!

27:19.611 --> 27:20.981
How is that the same?

27:21.960 --> 27:22.920
Back then, you had to marry

27:23.270 --> 27:26.000
and moved far away to the bitter cold
of the Central Circuit.

27:26.750 --> 27:27.270
But now,

27:28.000 --> 27:29.550
Meng Zaishi is at the palace.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.750
I won't allow him to leave Sheng'an.

27:33.200 --> 27:34.750
You want us both to become

27:35.440 --> 27:37.350
a pair of declawed, defanged playthings

27:37.640 --> 27:38.510
for your amusement?

27:38.750 --> 27:39.400
Do as you're told!

27:53.830 --> 27:54.440
Be obedient.

27:54.960 --> 27:57.110
You're my precious daughter.

27:57.510 --> 27:58.440
As your father, I'll

27:59.350 --> 28:00.310
arrange your marriage

28:01.640 --> 28:02.350
and grant you both

28:02.960 --> 28:03.960
the right to settle in Sheng'an.

28:11.070 --> 28:12.750
A wolf will never become a vegetarian.

28:14.440 --> 28:15.640
He won't agree.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.480
He already has.

28:59.030 --> 28:59.680
What rotten luck!

29:00.200 --> 29:01.270
What's with all this spooky behavior?

29:04.680 --> 29:05.350
Excuse me.

29:06.590 --> 29:07.350
Is today

29:08.030 --> 29:09.110
the fifteenth?

29:10.680 --> 29:11.790
What time is it?

29:15.030 --> 29:16.160
Can't you see that huge moon?

29:21.160 --> 29:21.920
It's just past the hour of Hai.

30:19.240 --> 30:20.200
That physician

30:21.270 --> 30:22.590
was right after all.

30:25.720 --> 30:28.160
General Meng has been granted
the title of Prince Consort.

30:28.680 --> 30:31.310
His Majesty asks Your Highness
to make preparations.

30:31.680 --> 30:34.160
The wedding will take place
in three days.

30:36.310 --> 30:38.310
How could he agree to such humiliation?

30:39.830 --> 30:40.590
He's lost his mind.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.859
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
and the Court of State Ceremonial

30:43.901 --> 30:45.771
are urgently working out
the wedding arrangements.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.510
What does the Court of State
Ceremonial have to do with this?

30:48.160 --> 30:49.350
Because the Prince Consort

30:49.790 --> 30:51.680
made a request of His Majesty.

31:00.440 --> 31:01.830
Your Majesty has shown me
boundless generosity

31:03.720 --> 31:04.920
by granting me the Princess's hand.

31:06.640 --> 31:08.070
I'm deeply humbled.

31:09.920 --> 31:11.000
I have only one wish.

31:12.030 --> 31:13.790
I humbly ask Your Majesty to grant it.

31:16.720 --> 31:18.480
For my wedding to Princess Danyang,

31:19.510 --> 31:22.880
I ask that we follow the wedding customs
of both Sheng'an and North Jing equally.

31:25.350 --> 31:27.880
For this is not merely a celebration
for my family.

31:29.640 --> 31:32.480
It is an honor for all three military
districts of North Jing.

31:36.000 --> 31:36.939
The wedding protocol

31:36.981 --> 31:39.331
must be revised by both courts
and the Ministry of Rites.

31:39.920 --> 31:40.400
However,

31:41.110 --> 31:43.960
the ceremonial robes, headdress,
and jewelry for Your Highness

31:44.350 --> 31:45.350
are already prepared.

31:46.720 --> 31:47.160
Come in!

32:00.140 --> 32:01.480
(Suicheng)

32:01.480 --> 32:06.040
(Wenmo Pavilion; Suicheng; Inn)

32:16.110 --> 32:16.590
Sir!

32:17.830 --> 32:18.310
Sir!

32:27.160 --> 32:27.830
My master...

32:29.270 --> 32:30.720
He's been dismissed and imprisoned.

32:31.590 --> 32:32.480
All his family's land and property

32:33.270 --> 32:34.350
have been confiscated.

32:34.550 --> 32:35.440
If I'd been any later,

32:36.110 --> 32:37.440
I wouldn't have escaped,

32:37.790 --> 32:39.680
and I'd never see you again.

32:47.960 --> 32:48.590
Take your time.

32:50.000 --> 32:51.030
Tell me everything from the beginning.

33:07.550 --> 33:08.550
Master left a message.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.350
He said the Liu family's downfall

33:11.110 --> 33:12.830
is all Yan Shang the Collator's doing.

33:13.200 --> 33:13.750
That is,

33:14.400 --> 33:16.240
your former classmate, sir.

33:38.960 --> 33:39.590
Now,

33:40.510 --> 33:42.070
the entire Liu family is ruined.

33:45.350 --> 33:46.110
He said

33:47.510 --> 33:48.400
only you

33:50.200 --> 33:51.880
can avenge the Liu family.

34:33.840 --> 34:34.230
Shang.

34:36.190 --> 34:36.630
It's me.

34:38.920 --> 34:39.550
Wenji.

34:55.190 --> 34:56.110
I've wronged you.

35:04.230 --> 35:05.030
Why do you say that?

35:06.960 --> 35:07.840
The Lingnan case...

35:10.840 --> 35:12.360
It's mostly been settled by now,
hasn't it?

35:14.360 --> 35:15.030
Your family...

35:20.230 --> 35:21.150
You can't manage that yourself, can you?

35:22.230 --> 35:22.710
I'll feed you.

35:29.230 --> 35:29.710
I'm sorry.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.000
My family is ruined.

35:50.710 --> 35:51.190
I know.

36:05.550 --> 36:06.190
This medicine

36:07.320 --> 36:08.480
improves circulation
and reduces bruising.

36:08.960 --> 36:09.710
It's very effective.

36:15.230 --> 36:16.000
Wenji.

36:21.550 --> 36:22.110
Thank you.

36:47.630 --> 36:48.000
Shang,

36:53.230 --> 36:54.880
I've been in the palace long enough.

36:57.150 --> 36:58.510
Do you think I can't see
what's happening?

37:00.800 --> 37:02.360
His Majesty was the one who sent you
to Lingnan.

37:05.150 --> 37:06.670
The moment he made that decision,

37:09.400 --> 37:10.480
my family was already doomed.

37:15.840 --> 37:17.760
If this is the outcome
His Majesty wanted,

37:20.000 --> 37:20.840
then it wouldn't matter

37:23.230 --> 37:23.920
who he sent.

37:27.550 --> 37:29.550
Even if he'd sent me,

37:33.440 --> 37:35.630
I'd have had no choice
but to put justice above family.

37:37.670 --> 37:38.360
Wenji...

38:05.840 --> 38:06.510
What happened to your eyes?

38:08.630 --> 38:09.510
While I was in Lingnan,

38:10.150 --> 38:11.280
I had a little accident.

38:12.840 --> 38:13.590
I've lost my sight.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.230
Don't worry.

38:16.070 --> 38:16.880
I'll find a way to help.

38:18.150 --> 38:19.150
I'll get an imperial physician
to see you.

38:22.510 --> 38:23.230
No need.

38:24.190 --> 38:25.000
That won't be difficult to arrange.

38:30.630 --> 38:32.110
His Majesty doesn't want you dead yet.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.190
There's something else

38:50.190 --> 38:51.150
you probably don't know.

38:56.190 --> 38:57.670
His Majesty has arranged a marriage.

38:59.030 --> 39:00.030
Meng Zaishi

39:01.280 --> 39:02.840
is to marry Princess Danyang.

39:34.190 --> 39:35.070
We're stuck again?

39:37.760 --> 39:38.480
I'll get out and take a look.

39:38.880 --> 39:39.360
Pacification Commissioner,

39:41.070 --> 39:41.960
you may have to get out.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.070
I'm afraid

39:44.760 --> 39:45.590
we can't go any farther.

39:52.020 --> 39:56.660
(North Jing)

40:07.880 --> 40:09.360
General Meng can't come back,

40:09.880 --> 40:11.000
so they sent you instead?

40:12.590 --> 40:14.110
They claim to have a written order.

40:15.000 --> 40:15.440
Show me!

40:26.150 --> 40:27.550
(An Shahe, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard)
All is well.

40:28.400 --> 40:30.070
I'll return soon.

40:37.190 --> 40:38.739
Didn't that darned emperor
say the same thing

40:38.781 --> 40:40.091
when he let you return?

40:40.360 --> 40:41.630
It's all just empty promises!

40:44.000 --> 40:45.590
General Meng wrote this himself!

40:46.000 --> 40:47.630
Do you think he'd be pleased
to hear you say that?

40:48.960 --> 40:50.360
I also have a decree from His Majesty.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.590
When Yu's faction plotted rebellion,

40:55.110 --> 40:56.000
the imperial court was thrown
into chaos.

40:56.280 --> 40:57.590
You led the Gray Wolf Cavalry

40:57.920 --> 40:58.880
and rushed to my rescue.

40:59.150 --> 41:00.110
What that means is,

41:00.440 --> 41:02.920
Yu Cheng'an was terrible
when he controlled the court,

41:03.440 --> 41:05.190
but General Meng saved His Majesty

41:05.480 --> 41:06.070
and rendered great service.

41:06.920 --> 41:07.510
He is hereby promoted

41:07.840 --> 41:09.440
to Commander of All Military Affairs
in North Jing,

41:09.840 --> 41:10.510
with a fief yielding revenue

41:11.070 --> 41:11.630
from 500 households.

41:12.670 --> 41:13.190
In short,

41:13.630 --> 41:15.030
His Majesty has rewarded him generously

41:15.510 --> 41:17.320
and invited him to stay
at the palace a little longer.

41:20.320 --> 41:20.590
You...

41:20.710 --> 41:21.880
I get it now!

41:21.960 --> 41:24.230
That darned emperor is holding
General Meng hostage!

41:25.000 --> 41:27.169
No! General Meng will come back!

41:27.211 --> 41:27.901
When will he be back?

41:28.190 --> 41:29.070
Is that up to you?

41:29.590 --> 41:30.880
No, wait! Let him go first!

41:31.070 --> 41:31.760
Let him go!

41:31.880 --> 41:33.840
Let go! Let go!

41:34.630 --> 41:35.630
Let go!

41:38.550 --> 41:39.000
What do we do?

41:39.880 --> 41:41.070
The general must be in danger.

41:41.360 --> 41:42.590
(Gu Han, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard)
Muster the troops! We march now!

41:42.920 --> 41:43.550
As for these two,

41:44.190 --> 41:44.800
kill them now!

41:46.110 --> 41:46.960
Go ahead and march!

41:47.480 --> 41:48.880
You'll be the ones
who get General Meng killed!

41:49.110 --> 41:50.230
General Meng gave no such order,

41:50.630 --> 41:51.760
yet you're mobilizing troops
without his permission.

41:52.150 --> 41:53.590
Are you really worried about his safety,

41:54.110 --> 41:55.569
or are you trying to seize
his position in the chaos?

41:55.611 --> 41:56.941
Nonsense!

41:58.320 --> 42:00.110
If you're truly concerned
for General Meng's safety,

42:00.360 --> 42:01.480
then let him finish!

42:03.070 --> 42:04.760
If His Majesty really intended
to kill General Meng,

42:05.110 --> 42:06.550
why would he send us with a message?

42:07.320 --> 42:09.320
To invite North Jing's army
to lay waste to Sheng'an?

42:12.840 --> 42:13.840
Mu Xianqing is dead.

42:14.710 --> 42:17.070
All of North Jing now follows
General Meng's command.

42:17.880 --> 42:19.230
With 100,000 soldiers under his command,

42:19.480 --> 42:20.920
if His Majesty were to kill him,

42:21.480 --> 42:22.960
wouldn't he fear a rebellion
in North Jing?

42:24.280 --> 42:25.030
He's the top scholar!

42:25.360 --> 42:27.230
All he knows is reading classics
and writing essays.

42:27.590 --> 42:28.670
He couldn't even kill a chicken!

42:29.070 --> 42:29.819
He brought only me, a defenseless woman,

42:29.861 --> 42:31.051
to deliver this message,

42:31.360 --> 42:32.190
without a single armed soldier.

42:32.710 --> 42:34.960
Doesn't that prove Huai's sincerity?

42:40.360 --> 42:41.590
That emperor is cunning.

42:42.280 --> 42:43.920
He sent these two helpless lambs here.

42:44.550 --> 42:46.320
Who knows what he's really plotting?

42:46.590 --> 42:47.070
Kill them!

42:47.550 --> 42:48.710
General Meng is unharmed for now,

42:49.440 --> 42:50.590
but his life truly hangs by a thread!

42:50.840 --> 42:51.190
What?

42:53.030 --> 42:54.230
Every word I've said is true.

42:54.590 --> 42:55.710
Think carefully, and you'll understand.

42:56.030 --> 42:56.960
What His Majesty fears

42:57.320 --> 42:58.070
isn't General Meng himself,

42:58.920 --> 43:00.360
but another Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors.

43:01.280 --> 43:02.670
As long as you hold your positions here,

43:03.150 --> 43:03.670
the court

43:04.280 --> 43:05.760
won't dare lay a finger on General Meng.

43:06.960 --> 43:08.400
None of that matters!

43:08.800 --> 43:09.800
Just answer me!

43:10.150 --> 43:12.710
Why is that emperor
holding General Meng?

43:13.550 --> 43:14.360
Isn't it obvious?

43:14.710 --> 43:16.880
General Meng is a hostage now!

43:20.150 --> 43:21.000
Which means,

43:21.670 --> 43:23.190
the person most afraid
of anything happening to him

43:23.800 --> 43:24.480
isn't any of you,

43:25.440 --> 43:26.630
but the Emperor of Huai.

43:47.630 --> 43:48.710
Take them away

43:49.230 --> 43:49.670
and get them settled.

45:00.340 --> 45:04.780
(Next Episode Preview)

45:05.630 --> 45:06.840
Don't let your general down.

45:07.510 --> 45:08.800
Don't let him die for nothing!

45:10.150 --> 45:10.960
I'm going back

45:11.670 --> 45:12.670
to demand justice

45:13.230 --> 45:14.230
for General Meng.

45:15.510 --> 45:18.400
Princess Danyang has returned
from North Jing.

45:21.481 --> 45:24.774
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:27.459 --> 45:32.375
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:34.569 --> 45:40.414
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:40.914 --> 45:46.140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:48.909 --> 45:53.700
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:54.536 --> 46:00.615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:02.416 --> 46:05.566
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:05.566 --> 46:07.214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:07.266 --> 46:10.990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:11.368 --> 46:16.034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:16.653 --> 46:20.694
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:21.185 --> 46:23.300
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:23.340 --> 46:30.286
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:31.049 --> 46:34.502
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:34.682 --> 46:37.827
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:38.266 --> 46:44.903
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:45.300 --> 46:47.338
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:47.338 --> 46:49.814
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:49.852 --> 46:52.321
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:52.525 --> 46:59.412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:59.724 --> 47:02.995
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:03.300 --> 47:06.473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:06.797 --> 47:10.223
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:10.456 --> 47:13.681
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:14.012 --> 47:20.808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:21.177 --> 47:23.239
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:23.240 --> 47:25.743
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:25.790 --> 47:28.128
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:28.359 --> 47:35.194
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:35.543 --> 47:37.161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:37.291 --> 47:39.087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:39.444 --> 47:42.461
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:42.501 --> 47:43.828
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

47:43.828 --> 47:44.828
MkvDrama.net
